d 'FASTRGINI': module to provide fast calculation of conventional and reciprocal Gini coefficients, bilateral inequality level, and orientation
d
d      fastrgini calculates six distributional statistics for one
d positive-valued variable, using sorted-data algorithms
d implemented in    Mata. It extends the approach of fastgini
d (Sajaia, 2007) by calculating the conventional Gini together with
d its reciprocal    counterpart and associated measures. 
d
d KW: Gini coefficient
d KW: reciprocal
d
d Requires: Stata version 10
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261102
d
d Author:    Louis Chauvel, University of Luxembourg
d Support: email   louis.chauvel@@uni.lu
d
f fastrgini.ado
f fastrgini.sthlp
